[00:18.14]1.  Jehovah, the Maker of heaven,
[00:23.78]By heaven you can’t be contained,
[00:28.48]Even less an earthly dwelling place.
[00:33.18]But your spirit can here remain.
[00:38.10]Adorning this center of worship
[00:42.94]Are people who walk in your light.
[00:46.94]We rejoice to serve in unity;
[00:51.94]Our devotion is your delight.
[00:54.44](Bridge)
[00:56.94]There is nothing we have
[01:01.94]That you haven’t provided.
[01:05.94]From your own hand, we’ve given
[01:09.94]All that we offer you.
[01:13.09](Chorus)
[01:16.24]For all you have done, we are grateful;
[01:19.39]Our voices in song we now raise.
[01:26.39]For you’ve made our hope reality
[01:31.39]With this place that will bring you praise.
[01:35.66]2.  Jehovah, you knew that we wanted
[01:39.93]A place that will bring to you praise
[01:47.93]And will serve the needs of worshippers,
[01:52.93]Helping others to walk your ways.
[01:57.93]And now may this place serve your purpose.
[02:00.41]There’s work needing yet to be done,
[02:06.73]To pick up the pace and carry on
[02:13.05]In the work given by your Son.
[02:15.66](Bridge)
[02:18.28]So we offer the best
[02:20.89]Of our time and possessions.
[02:25.89]You alone are deserving—
[02:28.89]Giver of all good things.
[02:32.39](Chorus)
[02:35.89]For all you have done, we are grateful;
[02:42.62]Our voices in song we now raise.
[02:46.12]For you’ve made our hope reality
[02:49.62]With this place that will bring you praise.